# The cross compiled Linux binaries.
#
# The root .gitignore anchors its binary patterns at the repository root
# (/bin/, /penstock, /llmsim) on purpose, so it does not reach this
# directory. These are build artifacts like any other: reproduce them
# with the two commands in setup.sh's header, or from the "Reproducing
# this" section of docs/comparison.md.
#
#   GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o bin/penstock ./cmd/penstock
#   GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o bin/llmsim   ./cmd/llmsim
#
# The binary that produced the published numbers is identified by the
# SHA256 prefix recorded in each run's .meta.json, which is what
# fingerprinting exists for.
bin/
